st annually.", "criterionId": 2, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.2.3"}, {"complianceId": 25, "complianceSummary": "The CEO maintains participation of all communities around health facilities within the province.", "criterionId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.3.11"}, {"complianceId": 26, "complianceSummary": "The CEO ensures that health infrastructure and capital projects are effectively coordinated through a \"Projects Unit\" to oversee the development, funding and implementation of all Health Infrastructure and Capital Projects.", "criterionId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.3.12"}, {"complianceId": 15, "complianceSummary": "The CEO ensures a Senior Executive Management Team (SEMT) is appointed to manage the delivery of high-quality health services within the province in accordance with corporate policies relevant to applicable legislation, health policies and health Priorities.", "criterionId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.3.1"}, {"complianceId": 16, "complianceSummary": "The CEO and SEMT undertake annual review of own performance through 360-degree feedback via a management and staff survey.", "criterionId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.3.2"}, {"complianceId": 17, "complianceSummary": "The Organisation establishes a Clinical and Public Health Governance Framework to support effective implementation of the National Health Service Standards (NHSS).", "criterionId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.3.3"}, {"complianceId": 18, "complianceSummary": "The CEO, Director Curative Health Services and the Director Public Health are collectively responsible to ensure all health services and public health programmes are planned, monitored and reported on effectively.", "criterionId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.3.4"}, {"complianceId": 27, "complianceSummary": "The CEO has an approved °Corporate Risks Management Plan\" linked to the 5yr strategic health services development plan, to ensure a framework for the management of risks at all levels of the organisation (i.e.: strategic, programme /projects, and single issues).", "criterionId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.3.13"}, {"complianceId": 28, "complianceSummary": "There are weekly meetings between Management and staff to discuss work activities planning, AIP implementation, service issues / challenges, safety and quality, etc.", "criterionId": 4, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.4.1"}, {"complianceId": 29, "complianceSummary": "An organisational Health Human Resources (HHR) Unit and Health Workforce Plan is established and functioning effectively every year.", "criterionId": 4, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.4.2"}, {"complianceId": 30, "complianceSummary": "A Health Training Resources Unit (HTRU) and Health Workforce Training Plan is established and functioning effectively within the organisation, every year.", "criterionId": 4, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.4.3"}, {"complianceId": 31, "complianceSummary": "An organisational Assets and Equipment Policy and 5-year Plan is developed, budgeted for, implemented and effectively managed every year.", "criterionId": 4, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.4.4"}, {"complianceId": 32, "complianceSummary": "An organisational Fleet Management Policy, and 5-year Plan is developed, budgeted for, implemented and the transport fleet effectively managed every year.", "criterionId": 4, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.4.5"}, {"complianceId": 33, "complianceSummary": "An organisational Facility Management Program and 5-year Plan is developed, budgeted for, implemented and all maintenance of every health facility effectively managed, each year.", "criterionId": 4, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.4.6"}, {"complianceId": 34, "complianceSummary": "An organisational ICT Services & Network Policy and 5-year Plan is developed, budgeted for, and effec