ganisation policies and procedures occurs throughout the organisational health service.", "criterionId": 8, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.7.2"}, {"complianceId": 44, "complianceSummary": "All organisational policies and procedures are reviewed and revised as necessary.", "criterionId": 8, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.7.3"}, {"complianceId": 45, "complianceSummary": "The Organisation has an approved framework for the development, implementation and ongoing monitoring and evaluation (M&E) of all its health program and projects.", "criterionId": 8, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.7.4"}, {"complianceId": 46, "complianceSummary": "Rights and responsibilities of patients are clearly addressed through policies set by the Board of Governance and there are protocols to deal with matters of complaint.", "criterionId": 9, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.8.1"}, {"complianceId": 47, "complianceSummary": "Respect for patients/clients is evident throughout the healthcare organisation.", "criterionId": 9, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.8.2"}, {"complianceId": 48, "complianceSummary": "The Board of Governance ensures that there is a mechanism for considering ethical issues by an appropriate ethics committee.", "criterionId": 10, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.9.1"}, {"complianceId": 4, "complianceSummary": "The Board of Governance has established their organization''s Vision, Mission, Goals, & Objectives to specify and guide the delivery of health services.", "criterionId": 1, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.1.4"}, {"complianceId": 5, "complianceSummary": "The Board of Governance has overall responsibility for the organization''s achievements, the quality of healthcare and the organization''s resources.", "criterionId": 1, "isApplicable": true, "complianceNumber": "1.1.5"}, {"complianceId": 6, "complianceSummary": "The Board of Governance ensures that there are effective working relatio