rm the appointments of the Governing body.", "complianceId": 1, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "2"}, {"evidenceId": 2, "evidenceSummary": "Documented, and signed \"Roles & Responsibilities'' of the Chairperson and Deputy Chairperson.", "complianceId": 1, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "1"}, {"evidenceId": 3, "evidenceSummary": "Governing Body meeting minutes verify appointment of Chairperson and Deputy Chairperson which are published or gazetted.", "complianceId": 1, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "3"}, {"evidenceId": 5, "evidenceSummary": "Documented statement showing Members & Officers appointed to Governing Body Committee understand, accept and signed their roles and responsibilities.", "complianceId": 1, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "5"}, {"evidenceId": 4, "evidenceSummary": "Governing Body have established these Committees, each with clearly defined \"Roles & Responsibilities'';\n- \tInternal Audit Committee\n- \tPartnership Committee\n- \tCorporate Services Committee\n- \tCurative Health Services Committee\n- \tPublic Health Services Committee\n- \tCapital Works Committee\n- \tFinance and Budget Committee", "complianceId": 1, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "4"}, {"evidenceId": 7, "evidenceSummary": "There is evidence of an orientation program for new members of the Board of Governance (see attendance list and orientation programme agenda).", "complianceId": 2, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "1"}, {"evidenceId": 8, "evidenceSummary": "There is evidence that members of the Board of Governance have attended relevant seminars, conferences, lectures.", "complianceId": 3, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "1"}, {"evidenceId": 24, "evidenceSummary": "There is evidence of existing policy for senior and middle management or nominated officers for their attendance, roles and functions during scheduled meetings.", "complianceId": 11, "isApplicable": true, "evidenceNumber": "1"}, {"evidenceId": 25, "evidenceSum